{"title":"The Forge on the Fourth Floor","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The orcs are forging spearheads deep in their compound. Sergeant Ilsa Varne wants the forge stopped and whatever orders it runs on.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/sergeant-ilsa-varne\">Sergeant Ilsa Varne</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"sergeant-ilsa-varne\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/orc-raid-orders\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/530e921c89bd8269d8a9.svg\" alt=\"\">Orc Raid Orders</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/sergeant-ilsa-varne\">Sergeant Ilsa Varne</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Underleaf)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"sergeant-ilsa-varne\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 12 orcs <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Defeat Gorrat the Forgemaster <span class=\"muted\">inside <a href=\"#\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"place\" data-map-id=\"Orc Lair\">Orc Lair</a></span><br>Bring the raid orders to Sergeant Ilsa Varne - <a href=\"#/item/orc-raid-orders\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/530e921c89bd8269d8a9.svg\" alt=\"\">Orc Raid Orders</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -62, 206</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-62|206|Bring the raid orders to Sergeant Ilsa Varne\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>560</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>25,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Choose one</td><td><a href=\"#/item/silver-longsword\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/36c081655f0175a8eac5.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Longsword</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/oak-longbow\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/38f5706b16dfda53ae8d.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Longbow</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/oak-staff\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Staff</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/silver-shield\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/cc36211c4f2a44a45d5a.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Shield</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Forge on the Fourth Floor</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-forge-on-the-fourth-floor\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-forge-on-the-fourth-floor\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-forge-on-the-fourth-floor\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-forge-on-the-fourth-floor\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}